OL,3,GNEWSARobbie Williams to headline
OL,4,ABritish Grand Prix gig
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobbie Williams will headline a concert
OL,7,Fahead of next year's British Grand
OL,8,FPrix.
OL,10,FThe organisers at Silverstone in
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire said the pop star
OL,12,Fwould "launch the weekend in
OL,13,Funmistakable style".
OL,15,FThe singer, whose hits include Rock DJ,
OL,16,FAngels and Let Me Entertain You, will
OL,17,Fopen a weekend of music at the sporting
OL,18,Fevent on Thursday 1 July.
OL,20,FPrevious headliners include David
OL,21,FGuetta and James Arthur.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
